  "notes": "Gilsey Avenue and Iliff Avenue both jog at Glenway: north legs at x~3239 and ~3665, south legs at x~3103 and ~3517 (each recorded as two T's). The south leg of Gilsey is labelled GILSEY between Weber Lane and St. Lawrence; south of St. Lawrence the same street is labelled SUIRE (and 'AVE.' at y~4400), so the St. Lawrence crossing is recorded under both names. Rosemont is narrow (~30 ft) north of Glenway, 60 ft south of it. Liberty's north side is the plate edge; N-S streets show as notches past it, so Liberty crossings are 'cross'. Bottom street (tracks at y~5870, plate edge ~5917) taken as West 8th Street: its name was not printed in my crops. VINCENT printed with no suffix seen; St. Lawrence printed 'ST. LAWRENCE' with no suffix seen; Glenway named from the 'GLENWAY' label west of the strip (x~1200). Regina (north of St. Lawrence, x~4003) and Harris (south of it, x~3872) are offset, recorded as two T's."
